  <wpt lat="26.586998" lon="93.410581">
    <name>Kaziranga National Park</name>
    <desc>verified 2026-09-26: national park (large area): display and drive at Kohora, the main (central range) entrance; the query's Kanchanjuri is the park's postal locality about 15 minutes west near Bagori, with no authoritative coordinate found</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="25.307169" lon="83.010336">
    <name>Ganges</name>
    <desc>verified 2026-09-26: the Ganges at Varanasi (large area): display and drive at Dashashwamedh Ghat, the main river-front visitor point; the query's Katesar lies on the opposite (east) bank, and Nominatim had a river point 25 km downstream</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="22.306201" lon="80.529013">
    <name>Kanha National Park</name>
